{
    "title": "Overmortal",
    "description": "Step into a brand new fantasy world in Overmortal, a captivating text-based adventure Card RPG.\r\n\r\n\r\nBorn as a nobody? This world will show you that anything is possible! Immerse yourself in the extraordinary journey of transforming from a mortal to an immortal, unraveling the secrets behind your seemingly ordinary origin.\r\nA vivid tapestry unfurls before you: exploring countless Realms, engaging in story-driven dialogs with NPCs, challenging bosses from different Worlds, evolving your pets into human-like companions, combining your skills, and soaring to the top on your server.\r\n\r\nEach choice leads you towards an unknown branch...\r\n\r\n[PICK YOUR OWN PATH]\r\nOn the path to power, choices abound. Will you embrace darkness or brightness? Each decision carries its own price, and in turn, bestows upon you a unique gift of fate.\r\nOf course, you can just go with the flow and enjoy your adventure in the fantasy world without making tough decisions!\r\n\r\n[MASTER YOUR SKILLS AND PATHS]\r\nWill you enhance your physical form, practice magic, or become a master of the sword? Choose your skills and paths to unleash the ultimate combat prowess!\r\n\r\n[EFFORTLESS IDLE GAINs]\r\nOnly want to enjoy text adventures? Our auto-play feature frees your from toils and grinding!\r\n\r\n[SOLO OR X-SERVER BATTLES?]\r\nSeeking to immerse yourself in the enchanting world alone? Absolutely possible.\r\nCraving to break free from the traditional single-player mode of Card RPGs and engage in PvP battles with adventurers from around the globe? Here, your dreams can come true!\r\n\r\n[PETS IN HUMAN FORMS?]\r\nPets here are more than just pets! Turn your pets into human-like companions to get on the adventure with you!\r\n\r\nFace Book Fanseite: https://www.facebook.com/OvermortalGlobal\r\nDiscord: https://discord.com/invite/V9vn3fCyK7",
